hivepack::lzo is a port of lzokay's decompressor (https://github.com/jackoalan/lzokay,
commit db2df1fcbebc2ed06c10f727f72567d40f06a2be) to Rust and is distributed
under the license of the code it is derived from, below. It is an altered
version of lzokay: the C++ source has been translated to Rust, and the
changes are marked in the source with comments that start with
"Differs from lzokay". The port returns what liblzo2's
lzo1x_decompress_safe returns, which the tests check against liblzo2 2.10;
liblzo2, under the GPL, is built only into that test oracle
(tools/lzo-oracle), never into hivepack, and none of its code is here.

Copyright (c) 2026 HivePaaS.


